Kenneth Roberts, Andrew Schrank, Ken Shadlen, and participants at the ￿￿￿￿ and ￿￿￿￿ APSA Annual Meetings, LSE’s ID
and CP/CPE seminars, MIT’s Political Methodology Research Series, and the ￿￿￿￿ Southwest Mixed-Methods Research
Workshop. We dedicate this paper to the memory of Kenneth Fairfield.

