## Thailand Visa on Arrival Guide

### Visa on Arrival Available

Indian passport holders can get visa on arrival at these airports

#### Available Airports:

- • Bangkok (Suvarnabhumi & Don Mueang)
- • Phuket International Airport
- • Chiang Mai International Airport
- • Hat Yai Airport

#### Requirements:

- • Passport valid for 6+ months
- • Return flight ticket
- • Hotel booking confirmation
- • THB 2,000 in cash
...
### Visa on Arrival Limitations

- • Maximum stay: 15 days (cannot be extended)
- • Available only for tourism purposes
- • Cannot be converted to other visa types
- • Requires proof of sufficient funds (THB 10,000 per person)

### Tourist Visa vs Visa on Arrival

| Aspect | Tourist Visa | Visa on Arrival |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Duration | 60 days | 15 days |
| Cost | ₹2,400 | ₹4,800 |
| Processing | 3-5 days advance | On arrival |
| Extension | Can extend 30 days | Cannot extend |

