The BTS accepts single journey tickets bought from machines at every station, fares ranging 17 to 62 THB depending on distance. For frequent use, buy a Rabbit Card: 200 THB total, which includes a 100 THB non refundable issue fee and 100 THB of stored value. Minimum top up is 100 THB, maximum stored value is 4,000 THB, and the card remains valid for seven years from the last top up. A day pass costs 150 THB for unlimited rides on the issue date only. The Rabbit Card does not work on the MRT.
