If you want to share a Songthaew to Doi Suthep - go to the Chang Pauk Gate of the moat area. Just across the road from the moat (outside the old city) is where the Songthaew's leave for Doi Suthep. If you buy a Nancy Chandler map - it has on it places that Songthaews leave to go to particular areas. For example, if you want to go to San Kampaeng - they leave from just near Warorot Market. You can just flag one down to go to Doi Suthep and bargain hard. You'll pay a lot more than 30B. We did this - we paid for the driver to wait while we looked around for an hour and to drive us back. I think it was around 200B.

Make sure you have a coffee at the coffee shop on top of the hill near the temple.

