My Mac Mini is plugged in to USB port 2 and has never had any issues like this. I also don’t have any other issues like this with other USB devices on my Windows PC, I’ve made sure all power management features are disabled on my USB host controller, made sure devices aren’t set to sleep, there’s no errors showing up in Windows event viewer…long story short, I’m at my wit’s end here, so unless Rode pulls a rabbit out of their hat, I’m at a loss.

