Windows may automatically disable unused playback and recording devices.

1. Open Windows Sound Settings.
2. Select More Sound Settings (Windows 11).
3. Right click within the device list and enable Show Disabled Devices.
4. Enable any disabled RØDECaster playback and recording devices.

 Tip: Check both the Playback and Recording tabs, as Windows may disable devices in either category.

