Regulation (EU) 2024/1183 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 11 April 2024 amending Regulation (EU) No 910/2014 as regards establishing the European Digital Identity Framework, commonly referred to as eIDAS 2 or the European Digital Identity Regulation, is a regulation of the European Union that establishes a comprehensive legal framework for a European Digital Identity ecosystem, with the EU Digital Identity Wallet(EUDI Wallet) at its centre. The regulation amends its predecessor, Regulation (EU) No 910/2014 (known as eIDAS), which had governed electronic identification and trust services for electronic transactions in the internal market since 2014.
