If your document is lost or stolen, the certificates of your document must be revoked to prevent the potential digital misuse. Here you can revoke the certificates of documents issued as of 15.11.2025. In order to close the certificates of documents issued prior to this date, please call +372 677 3377. Revoked certificates cannot be used for accessing e-services or for digital signing. It is not possible to reactivate revoked certificates (for example in case the document is found); therefore, you will need to apply for a new document in order to use the document electronically. If you do not need to use the document electronically, it will still be valid for physical identification (except for the e-resident’s digital identity card) until the expiry date on the document.
