The Maroczy Bind occurs simply when white has a pawn on e4 and on c4 and no d pawn and black has a d-pawn. It can more or less occur at any stage. Just when the position happens, so it isn't any specific move order. Since in the Open Sicilian, white has no d-pawn but has a pawn on e4, the Sicilian can easily lead to such a position.

